WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 5 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:45.700
His moves were amazing before the shark intervened.

2
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.700
I'm not as skilled as before, but…

3
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.700
I still ride the waves.

4
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.700
Thank you for saving my life.

5
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.700
You are the god of the island.

6
00:00:53.700 --> 00:01:09.460
Please, no one can know my identity.

7
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.460
As you wish, but how can I repay you?

8
00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.460
Actually, there is a favor…

9
00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.460
…you can do for me.

10
00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:17.460
Anything.

11
00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.460
My wife, Lujain Al-Zain.

12
00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.460
One of the best female surfers in the world.

13
00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:25.700
Her leg was just injured.

14
00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.700
I took you.

15
00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.700
Her leg was just injured.

16
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:40.980
Najwa.

17
00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.980
I wish I had healing powers.

18
00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:44.980
I told you, I caught up with him, but…

19
00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:46.980
The god of the island is the one who saved your mother.

20
00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.980
It seems he cast a spell…

21
00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.980
…of healing on her leg.

22
00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:52.980
Thank you for your help.

23
00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:54.980
He needs our help.

24
00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.980
His wife Lujain needs care.

25
00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:58.980
His wife.

26
00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.980
She is an amazing surfer.
